'''Razor Hill''' is an [[orc]]ish outpost built on a crossroads in central [[Durotar]]. The southern road eventually leads to [[Sen'Jin Village]] and the [[Valley of Trials]]. The northern road leads to [[Orgrimmar]], and the road west ends up in [[the Barrens]] and eventually to the major [[Horde]] gathering point of the [[Crossroads]]. The [[Razor Hill Barracks]] is the single most prominent structure in the town. The orc, [[Orgnil Soulscar]] is the current leader of Razor Hill, occupied with investigating the activities of the [[Burning Blade]] in the area. 

Razor Hill is the second place of training for all new orcs and trolls except mages. Usually people achieve level 10 before venturing on to [[the Barrens]].

Shortly after the [[Third War]], the forces of [[Kul Tiras]] arranged a summit with Thrall at Razor Hill. It was in fact a planned ambush. However, having speculated this, [[Rexxar]] insisted that he should go in Thrall's place. In turn, Rexxar defeated the assassins. 

